include/ps2/vu_ops.hpp derives from runtime/include/ps2/vu_ops.hpp; only relative includes use the existing PS2 ABI include paths.
include/ps2/vu_semantics.hpp extracts UpperOut/upper/commit, BranchView and lower from runtime/src/vu_micro.cpp. Runtime globals are replaced by the Console-owned Unit, unsupported opcodes throw instead of logging and continuing, and VNOP is explicit. GIF kick remains a concrete unsupported consumer boundary.
The engine-owned resumable pair emitter specializes those semantics on verified instruction words, sharing the reference pipeline and branch history. No whole-program runner, state system, live compiler, worker, GS, VIF or runtime globals are imported.
